WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:06.760
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:11.300
Is a new legendary duel

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:28.260
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:33.880
Set free your infinite potential

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:39.490
Every beginning is up to you

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:46.090
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:51.400
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.970
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:04.820
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:10.020
Even if you can't see your destination

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.490
Run on your feet without fear

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:21.360
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:28.860
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.700
Z-one, this is the crystallization 
of Team 5D's bond!

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.320
This symbolizes our evolution!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.050
Yusei did it.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:56.570
It's the ultimate Synchro using 
five Synchro Monsters!

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.430
It symbolizes Yusei's evolution.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.020
And ours.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.930
And the crystallization of our power.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.570
Shooting Quasar Dragon!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.400
Limit Over Accel Synchro?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.290
Impossible.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.280
That wasn't written in our history!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:29.620
Father, I will protect the people 
and the city I was born in.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.440
Here I go, Z-one!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:48.840
Wishes Come Together

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.840
Here I go, Z-one!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.400
Feel our new power!

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:58.220
But Timelords can't be destroyed, 
and I take 0 damage.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:03.240
No matter how many new monsters you 
summon, you can't destroy the Timelords.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:04.750
You're wrong.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.460
Shooting Quasar Dragon can negate 
destruction-negating effects.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.160
What?

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.880
When Shooting Quasar 
Dragon attacks, it doesn't take

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.520
your monsters' effects, 
and it can attack

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.670
for every monster I used 
to Synchro Summon it!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.510
Now he can destroy the Timelords!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.470
Five monsters were used to Synchro
Summon Shooting Quasar Dragon.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.360
It can attack five times.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.980
Our bond gives you power!

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:30.820
Let's go, everyone!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.300
Go, Shooting Quasar Dragon!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.270
Attack the Timelords!

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.000
With the blast that
created the universe!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.370
The Creation Burst!

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.930
Only Sandaion is left!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.450
Shooting Quasar Dragon and Sandaion 
have the same number of attack points!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.800
Let's go, Lua!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:13.420
Yeah!

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.170
Go, Shooting Quasar Dragon!

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.490
Attack Sandaion, the Timelord!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.860
All the Timelords are destroyed.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.970
But it was mutual destruction.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.240
You also have no monsters on your field.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.800
What?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:58.230
Shooting Star Dragon?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.920
When Shooting Quasar Dragon is destroyed,

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.940
I can Special Summon Shooting Star 
Dragon by negating its effects!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.130
Shooting Star Dragon attacks Z-one directly!

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:11.210
Stardust Mirage!

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:30.230
A counterattack straight from the soul!
A surging wave of six attacks!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.400
See that, Z-one?

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:35.070
This is Yusei's... I mean, 
Team 5D's inner strength!

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.250
Z-one has 700 life points left!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.720
Win for us, Yusei!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:45.210
The future of Neo Domino City
 rests on your shoulders!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.580
He did it!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.280
He dealt a lot of damage to Z-one.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.920
Impressive, Yusei!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.040
He's close to defeating Z-one.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.190
Go, Yusei!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.250
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:06.700
By removing 7 Speed Counters, 
I draw one card from my deck!

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:14.950
I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:18.740
I am the last person alive.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:23.190
I survived many painful, long 
years to save the future.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.650
I have the right to change history.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.080
No, Z-one!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.890
No one has that right!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:35.590
Yusei, you deny my existence?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.830
If what you say about the future is true, 
then despair may be waiting for us.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:47.070
But no one has the right to take away 
a person's future, even if it's to save the world.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:52.510
Every person has the same amount 
of potential to change the future!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.810
Why won't you try to believe that?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.330
Because I don't have the time!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:13.660
Yusei!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:20.100
I'll show you that potential  
 is nothing against me!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.580
My turn!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.520
There's suddenly a storm!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.930
What's going to happen?

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.340
What?

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.370
Watch, Yusei.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.510
This is my power!

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.310
This is my grief!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.210
What's this tree?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:12.440
The Continuous Trap Infinite Light 
has an effect that activates

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.690
when I have summoned ten Timelords.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.660
Timelords emerge from ten lights.

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:23.510
Beyond the lights are hidden wisdom
that only the chosen saint can use.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:28.540
Emptiness becomes infinite, and the 
infinite light gives birth to the ultimate Timelord.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.010
Ultimate Timelord?

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:31.840
No way!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.380
Infinite Light's effect activates.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.530
I Special Summon Sephylon,
the Ultimate Timelord!

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.170
This is the ultimate Timelord?

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:06.910
You'll learn that you're powerless.

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.720
Sephylon's effect activates.

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:13.660
It Special Summons as many
 Timelords as possible to the field,

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:16.880
and they each have 4000 attack points.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:17.550
What?

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:23.220
Appear, Timelords Metaion, 
Sadion, Gabrion and Sandaion!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.990
Four Timelords have resurrected!

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:32.530
That means all of Yusei's 
efforts were for naught!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.330
That's not all.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:36.890
Sephylon, the Ultimate 
Timelord's attack points

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.500
equal the total of all 
the Timelords on the field.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.470
What?

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:50.380
20000 attack points!

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:53.690
Four Timelords have 4000 attack points.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.360
They're clearly stronger 
than Shooting Star Dragon.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.490
This situation is clearly
worse than before!

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:08.120
It seems our long battle 
finally comes to an end.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:13.570
Now the future will be saved, 
along with Neo Domino City's destruction!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.220
Go, Sephylon!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.540
Attack Shooting Star Dragon!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.310
Akashic Storm!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.100
Yusei!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.510
Farewell, Yusei.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.330
Vanish.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:53.510
I haven't given up on my future yet!

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:56.480
I flip over the trap card
Converging Wishes!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:11:01.080
When Shooting Star Dragon 
 is destroyed in battle,

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:04.380
battle damage is negated, and I can
Synchro Summon Stardust Dragon

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:08.460
by removing its Synchro Materials 
in the graveyard from play.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:14.470
Level 1 Turbo Synchron tunes 
Level 7 Power Tool Dragon!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.400
The wishes come together to 
form a new shining star!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.070
Become the path that lights the way!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.510
Synchro Summon!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.980
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:38.260
What's the point of summoning Stardust 
Dragon with 2500 attack points?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:42.250
I have four Timelords with  
4000 attack points each

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.560
and Sephyron, the Ultimate Timelord
with 20000 attack points.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:50.230
No, this Stardust Dragon is the 
crystallization of Team 5D's

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.980
and the people of this city's wishes!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.170
Converging Wishes's other effect activates!

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:59.020
Stardust Dragon gains attack points

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:03.710
equal to the total attack points of all 
Dragon-Type Synchro Monsters in my graveyard.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:07.780
There are seven Synchro 
Monsters in my graveyard!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.200
It's huge!

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.700
What incredible size!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:32.170
23000 attack points?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:36.590
By returning the Synchro Monsters 
in my graveyard back to my deck,

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:41.110
Converging Wishes forces your monster
to battle Stardust Dragon this turn!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.420
I choose Sephylon, the Ultimate Timelord!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:57.500
By removing a Timelord on my field from play, 
Sephylon's destruction and battle damage are negated.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.470
Let's battle, Z-one!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.710
Please, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.370
Let's go, Life Stream Dragon!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.330
Lend me your power, Black Rose Dragon!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.940
I'm counting on you, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:50.910
Take this!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:53.900
My soul, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:05.960
All right! Now all the shields 
protecting Sephylon are destroyed.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.060
Go!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.300
Yusei!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.210
This is my final attack!

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:34.760
Take our future, Z-one!

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.730
Our thoughts become the path that 
lights the way to the future!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:54.380
Stardust Dragon, attack Sephylon, 
the Ultimate Timelord!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.660
Shooting Sonic!

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:11.780
No way...  I lost?

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.700
It's finally over!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.270
A miraculous duel!

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:23.150
With a miraculous huge 
come-from-behind victory,

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:28.410
leading Neo Domino City to our
future is our hero, Yusei Fudo!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.380
He did it!
Incredible!

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:32.610
We're saved!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.350
Yusei!

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.920
Neo Domino City is saved!

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.080
Hooray!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.060
Yusei won!

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.420
You did it, Yusei!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.320
All right!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.000
Save this world and save Z-one!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:04.220
This is bad!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.080
Ark Cradle is falling apart!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.050
Everyone, run away!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.150
Z-one!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.940
Are you okay, Z-one?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.940
Yusei...

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.680
Hang in there.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.430
It's no use.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:43.650
My life control system is stopping.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:45.350
Z-one...

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:47.380
It's fine.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:51.580
My life was already at its limits.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:58.530
In truth, I also wanted to see 
you change the future.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:03.140
But I didn't have the time.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.840
Don't talk anymore!

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:12.870
Yusei, I was always alone.
However...

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:19.450
I remembered the bond with my 
dead friends to cheer myself up.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.690
But I'm tired.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:29.160
Yusei, was what I did wrong?

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:34.270
You only tried to create your own future.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:39.270
Your warning has deeply touched 
the people of today.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:43.670
As long as we don't forget 
it, we can change the future!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:50.810
Yusei, I saw you create a new 
future at the end of my life.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.720
You can do it.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:57.100
You can guide the people.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.860
But I still have something left to do.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.730
You're planning to die.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.570
To make Ark Cradle rise up,

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:15.470
I need to strike the minus-rotating Moment 
with the plus-rotating Moment.

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.710
That is my final task.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.140
Where are we?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.940
We're back to the surface.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:37.290
Look at that!

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:39.260
Crimson Dragon!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.960
It saved us.

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:42.930
Look!

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.030
Ark Cradle has stopped!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.500
Yusei is...

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.720
Still inside?

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:54.570
Yusei is still going to die?

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.390
No way!

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:58.040
But we changed the future
 by defeating Z-one!

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.510
This is bad!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.110
Yusei!

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:11.190
Z-one!

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:15.920
My body has the same Moment as you.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.160
I will strike the minus Moment with it.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.130
What?

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.430
You're entrusted with a new future.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.340
You must live!

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:29.350
Z-one!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.060
Z-one!

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:45.570
Aporia. Antinomy. Paradox.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:47.600
I'm soon coming to you.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.330
I can finally...

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.910
Ark Cradle is leaving.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.580
Z-one...

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.720
What's this?

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:36.510
Ark Cradle is...

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.030
It's vanishing!

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:39.900
Wait!

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.850
Yusei is still inside!

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.970
Yusei can't be there!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.450
He can't be!

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:57.390
Yusei!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.100
Yusei...

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.360
Yusei...

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.330
No way... Yusei...

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:08.500
What?

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.700
That's...

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.150
Yusei!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.320
Yusei!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.690
You're safe!

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:31.500
How dare you make us worry!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.920
Yusei!

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.500
Welcome home!

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:38.320
Everyone!

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:40.760
I'm home!

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:05.760
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:11.130
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:16.490
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:16.490 --> 00:22:19.120
Our hearts resonate

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:23.940
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:30.880
We'll find a place for us

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:38.030
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:43.020
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:49.280
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:57.530
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:22:57.530 --> 00:23:03.150
We will draw it forever
